Solution 1 presented by: shuja-u on Feb 10 2026

    hold(repeat(1, key(BTN_LEFT).wait(45)))

You can play with the wait between clicks. For some games 45 ms might be too low and they won't detect it, or you might want it faster. Usually if you go below 25 or 20 ms it doesn't work. You can also play with the number right after repeat for how many times you want it to click at a minimum every time you press the left click down.

